<title>JAPAN: Alinco - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Alinco - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 20, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 13.30		vs	   11.93</p>
<p> Operating	  868    million    vs	  735    million</p>
<p> Current	    831    million    vs	  545    million</p>
<p> Net		  366    million    vs	  147    million</p>
<p> EPS		   26.94 yen	  vs	   15.06 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     14 million	  vs	  10 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Alinco Inc is predominantly involved in manufacturing and sales of housing and construction equipment.</p>
